    </style>
</head>
<body>
    <h1>江湖人生模拟器</h1>
    <div class="intro-section" id="intro">
        <h2 class="intro-title">武侠世界欢迎您</h2>
        <div class="intro-content">
            <p>少侠恭喜来到武侠的世界，请容我给你介绍一下天赋与能力：</p>
            <p><strong>臂力</strong> - 影响你的攻击力，决定招式威力</p>
            <p><strong>身法</strong> - 主要影响闪避和命中，决定战斗灵活性</p>
            <p><strong>根骨</strong> - 影响武学修炼速度，决定内功成长</p>
            <p><strong>悟性</strong> - 影响武学消耗，决定招式领悟速度</p>
            <p>所有武学都受这些属性的加成，会影响武学整体威力。</p>
            <p>例如：独孤九剑受悟性加成大量，降龙十八掌受臂力加成显著。</p>
            <p>好了，介绍到此为止，少侠请创立角色体验武侠世界。</p>
        </div>
        <button class="start-btn" id="startGame">开始创建角色</button>
    </div>
    <div class="worldview-section">
        <h3 class="worldview-title">世界观</h3>
        <div class="intro-content">
            <p>江湖"是一个以武为尊的武侠世界，门派林立，正邪纷争不断。</p>
            <p>自三百年前"天机老人"破碎虚空以来，武林中便流传着"得天道者可成仙"的传说。</p>
            <p>各大门派为争夺传说中的《天机秘典》明争暗斗，江湖风云变幻。</p>
            <p>本世界观立足于金庸小说的武器功法体系，融合了传统武侠的经典元素。</p>
        </div>
    </div>
    <div class="nav-tabs">
        <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="creation">角色创建</button>
        <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="talents">天赋选择</button>
        <button class="nav-tab" data-tab="preview">角色预览</button>
    </div>
    <div id="creation" class="content-section">
        <form id="characterForm" class="character-form">
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="charName">姓名</label>
                    <input type="text" id="charName" placeholder="请输入侠士姓名" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="charGender">性别</label>
                    <select id="charGender" required>
                        <option value="male">男</option>
                        <option value="female">女</option>
                    </select>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="form-row">
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="charAge">年龄</label>
                    <input type="number" id="charAge" min="16" max="80" placeholder="16-80" required>
                </div>
                <div class="form-group">
                    <label for="charAppearance">相貌特点</label>
                    <textarea id="charAppearance" placeholder="描述你的外貌特征，如：面容清秀，眉间一点朱砂..."></textarea>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button type="button" class="btn btn-large" id="nextToTalents">下一步：分配资质</button>
        </form>
    </div>
    <div id="talents" class="content-section">
        <div class="stats-section">
            <h3 class="stats-title">武学资质</h3>
            <div class="points-remaining" id="pointsRemaining">剩余点数: 50</div>
            <div class="stat-control">
                <div class="stats-controls">
                    <span class="stat-name">臂力</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('strength', -1)">-</button>
                    <span class="stat-value" id="strengthValue">10</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('strength', 1)">+</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-control">
                <div class="stats-controls">
                    <span class="stat-name">身法</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('agility', -1)">-</button>
                    <span class="stat-value" id="agilityValue">10</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('agility', 1)">+</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-control">
                <div class="stats-controls">
                    <span class="stat-name">悟性</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('wisdom', -1)">-</button>
                    <span class="stat-value" id="wisdomValue">10</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('wisdom', 1)">+</button>
                </div>
            </div>
            <div class="stat-control">
                <div class="stats-controls">
                    <span class="stat-name">根骨</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('constitution', -1)">-</button>
                    <span class="stat-value" id="constitutionValue">10</span>
                    <button class="btn" onclick="adjustStat('constitution', 1)">+</button>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <div class="talent-section">
            <h3 class="talent-title">天赋选择</h3>
            <p>请选择一项天赋，它将增强你的某项资质</p>
            <div class="talent-grid">
                <div class="talent-card" onclick="selectTalent('powerful')">
                    <div class="talent-name">力大如牛</div>
                    <div class="talent-desc">臂力+10点</div>
                </div>
                <div class="talent-card" onclick="selectTalent('agile')">
                    <div class="talent-name">身轻如燕</div>
                    <div class="talent-desc">身法+10点</div>
                </div>
                <div class="talent-card" onclick="selectTalent('wise')">
                    <div class="talent-name">武学奇才</div>
                    <div class="talent-desc">悟性+10点</div>
                </div>
                <div class="talent-card" onclick="selectTalent('tough')">
                    <div class="talent-name">根骨绝佳</div>
                    <div class="talent-desc">根骨+10点</div>
                </div>
            </div>
        </div>
        <button type="button" class="btn btn-large" id="nextToPreview">创建角色</button>
    </div>
    <div id="preview" class="content-section">
        <div class="preview-section">
            <h3 class="preview-title">角色信息</h3>
            <div class="preview-content">
                <div class="preview-image">[角色形象]</div>
                <div class="preview-details">
                    <p><strong>姓名：</strong><span id="previewName"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>性别：</strong><span id="previewGender"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>年龄：</strong><span id="previewAge"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>相貌：</strong><span id="previewAppearance"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>臂力：</strong><span id="previewStrength"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>身法：</strong><span id="previewAgility"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>悟性：</strong><span id="previewWisdom"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>根骨：</strong><span id="previewConstitution"></span></p>
                    <p><strong>天赋：</strong><span id="previewTalent"></span></p>
                </div>
            </div>
            <button class="copy-btn" onclick="copyCharacterInfo()">一键复制角色信息</button>
            <button class="btn btn-large" onclick="resetCharacter()">创建新角色</button>
        </div>
    </div>
    <script>
        let characterData = {
            name: "",
            gender: "male",
            age: 20,
            appearance: "",
            stats: {
                strength: 10,
                agility: 10,
                wisdom: 10,
                constitution: 10
            },
            points: 50,
            talent: null
        };
        function adjustStat(stat, change) {
            if (change > 0 && characterData.points <= 0) return;
            if (change < 0 && characterData.stats[stat] <= 10) return;
            characterData.stats[stat] += change;
            characterData.points -= change;
            document.getElementById(stat + 'Value').textContent = characterData.stats[stat];
            document.getElementById('pointsRemaining').textContent = '剩余点数: ' + characterData.points;
        }
        function selectTalent(talent) {
            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.talent-card');
            cards.forEach(card => card.classList.remove('selected'));
            event.currentTarget.classList.add('selected');
            characterData.talent = talent;
        }
        function updatePreview() {
            document.getElementById('previewName').textContent = characterData.name;
            document.getElementById('previewGender').textContent = characterData.gender === 'male' ? '男' : '女';
            document.getElementById('previewAge').textContent = characterData.age;
            document.getElementById('previewAppearance').textContent = characterData.appearance || "未描述";
            document.getElementById('previewStrength').textContent = characterData.stats.strength;
            document.getElementById('previewAgility').textContent = characterData.stats.agility;
            document.getElementById('previewWisdom').textContent = characterData.stats.wisdom;
            document.getElementById('previewConstitution').textContent = characterData.stats.constitution;
            document.getElementById('previewTalent').textContent = getTalentName(characterData.talent);
        }
        function getTalentName(talent) {
            switch(talent) {
                case 'powerful': return '力大如牛';
                case 'agile': return '身轻如燕';
                case 'wise': return '武学奇才';
                case 'tough': return '根骨绝佳';
                default: return '无';
            }
        }
        function copyCharacterInfo() {
            const previewName = document.getElementById('previewName').textContent;
            const previewGender = document.getElementById('previewGender').textContent;
            const previewAge = document.getElementById('previewAge').textContent;
            const previewAppearance = document.getElementById('previewAppearance').textContent;
            const previewStrength = document.getElementById('previewStrength').textContent;
            const previewAgility = document.getElementById('previewAgility').textContent;
            const previewWisdom = document.getElementById('previewWisdom').textContent;
            const previewConstitution = document.getElementById('previewConstitution').textContent;
            const previewTalent = document.getElementById('previewTalent').textContent;
            const characterInfo = `姓名：${previewName}
性别：${previewGender}
年龄：${previewAge}
相貌：${previewAppearance}
臂力：${previewStrength}
身法：${previewAgility}
悟性：${previewWisdom}
根骨：${previewConstitution}
天赋：${previewTalent}`;
            navigator.clipboard.writeText(characterInfo).then(() => {
                alert('角色信息已复制到剪贴板！');
            }).catch(err => {
                console.error('复制失败:', err);
                alert('复制失败，请手动复制');
            });
        }
        function resetCharacter() {
            characterData = {
                name: "",
                gender: "male",
                age: 20,
                appearance: "",
                stats: {
                    strength: 10,
                    agility: 10,
                    wisdom: 10,
                    constitution: 10
                },
                points: 50,
                talent: null
            };
            document.getElementById('charName').value = "";
            document.getElementById('charGender').value = "male";
            document.getElementById('charAge').value = "";
            document.getElementById('charAppearance').value = "";
            document.getElementById('strengthValue').textContent = "10";
            document.getElementById('agilityValue').textContent = "10";
            document.getElementById('wisdomValue').textContent = "10";
            document.getElementById('constitutionValue').textContent = "10";
            document.getElementById('pointsRemaining').textContent = "剩余点数: 50";
            const cards = document.querySelectorAll('.talent-card');
            cards.forEach(card => card.classList.remove('selected'));
            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab');
            const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.content-section');
            tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
            sections.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
            document.querySelector('[data-tab="creation"]').classList.add('active');
            document.getElementById('creation').classList.add('active');
        }
        document.getElementById('startGame').addEventListener('click', function() {
            document.getElementById('intro').style.display = 'none';
            document.querySelector('.worldview-section').style.display = 'none';
            document.querySelector('.nav-tabs').style.display = 'flex';
            document.getElementById('creation').classList.add('active');
        });
        document.getElementById('nextToTalents').addEventListener('click', () => {
            characterData.name = document.getElementById('charName').value;
            characterData.gender = document.getElementById('charGender').value;
            characterData.age = parseInt(document.getElementById('charAge').value) || 20;
            characterData.appearance = document.getElementById('charAppearance').value;
            if (!characterData.name) {
                alert('请输入角色姓名');
                return;
            }
            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab');
            const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.content-section');
            tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
            sections.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
            document.querySelector('[data-tab="talents"]').classList.add('active');
            document.getElementById('talents').classList.add('active');
        });
        document.getElementById('nextToPreview').addEventListener('click', () => {
            if (characterData.points > 0) {
                alert('请分配所有剩余点数！');
                return;
            }
            updatePreview();
            const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab');
            const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.content-section');
            tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
            sections.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
            document.querySelector('[data-tab="preview"]').classList.add('active');
            document.getElementById('preview').classList.add('active');
        });
        const tabs = document.querySelectorAll('.nav-tab');
        tabs.forEach(tab => {
            tab.addEventListener('click', () => {
                const tabId = tab.dataset.tab;
                tabs.forEach(t => t.classList.remove('active'));
                tab.classList.add('active');
                const sections = document.querySelectorAll('.content-section');
                sections.forEach(s => s.classList.remove('active'));
                document.getElementById(tabId).classList.add('active');
            });
        });
    </script>
</body>
</html>
